<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00014332">James Pigg</persName><milestone unit="column" n="1"/><pb/></p>
<p>Pendleton Cir Ct
<lb/>vs
<lb/>S W Clark
<lb/>$60,
<lb/>Petition to be released of fine<figure type="hr"/>
<lb/><date when="1865-06-08">8<hi rend="sup">th</hi> June 1865</date></p>
